  "title": "V2X Reports First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "First Quarter Financial Highlights Increasing 2026 Guidance RESTON, Va., May 4, 2026 — V2X, Inc. (NYSE:VVX) today announced first quarter 2026 financial results, and increased guidance for full-year 2026. “V2X delivered a strong start to 2026, with double-digit growth on both the top and bottom lines, underscoring our team’s disciplined execution and our organization’s alignment […]",
